        "id": "1a3d5e3f-7b10-41b7-85df-5b1d814c6564",
        "name": "Protected API",
        "description": "Create a test that retreives a token and with that token retreive all the invoices of that signed in user.\n\nAdd a verification for the `total` property.\n\nSwagger: https://api.practicesoftwaretesting.com/api/documentation\n\nAccounts that can be used:\n\n\n| First name | Last name | Role   | E-mail                                | Password   |\n|------------|-----------|--------|---------------------------------------|------------|\n| John       | Doe       | admin  | admin@practicesoftwaretesting.com     | welcome01  |\n| Jane       | Doe       | user   | customer@practicesoftwaretesting.com  | welcome01  |\n| Jack       | Howe      | user   | customer2@practicesoftwaretesting.com | welcome01  |\n| Bob        | Smith     | user   | customer3@practicesoftwaretesting.com | pass123    |\n\n\n```flow\nflowchart LR\n  A([Start]) --> B[Get Token]\n  B --> C[Get Invoices]\n  C -->D([Done])\n```\n",
        "folders": [],
        "requestIds": []
      },
      {
        "id": "e0fc1664-803f-464e-8e7c-88f301c47518",
