      },
      "body": {
        "mode": "none"
      },
      "description": "Import the SOAP 1.2 `Add` and `Multiply` actions from http://www.dneonline.com/calculator.asmx?WSDL\n\n\n- Click on Import (next to the logo)\n- Select WSDL\n- Specify: http://www.dneonline.com/calculator.asmx?WSDL\n- Only import `Add` and `Multiply` to a new collection\n- change the SOAP bodies and add a verification\n\n"
    }
